      "description": {
        "text": "How I Became a Pokémon Card (ポケモンカードになったワケ) is a manga series by Kagemaru Himeno, one of the card game's illustrators, in six volumes from 1999 to 2001. Each chapter tells the story behind one of her card illustrations, and each volume came with a card of her own, in a paper envelope mounted inside the book.\n\nThis card came with volume 1, published on 22 May 1999, whose seventh chapter, \"Mankey, Mankey and Primeape\", is about her Jungle Mankey and Primeape cards. Its bottom edge names it a bonus card of the Pokémon Card Books \"How I Became a Pokémon Card\", and in place of a set symbol it has the series' mark, a small card on an open book, which five of the six cards carry.",
